type: software
title: "An empirical study of pivot selection in Bron-Kerbosch enumeration of maximal independent sets"
abstract: "Algorithm implementations, benchmark harness and analysis scripts for an ablation of the Bron-Kerbosch pivot rule, separating search-tree size from per-node cost across five variants of a single shared recursion."
